                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "t3",
                  "name": "summary",
                  "content": "Inspection is our only first-hand view before incidents.\nTwo years of manual spot checks reached under 40% of stores;\nreports bounce between paper and chat, and fixes go untimed.\nThis memo weighs three options and what each needs,\nand lists three items that need sign-off this month.",
