                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "t36",
                              "name": "body",
                              "content": "Regions don't grade the same check the same way:\nEast logs a cold-chain temperature breach as minor, South as severe,\nand at group level both land in the same number.",
